# Same Google OAuth web client ID as the API GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID.
# Required for Sign in with Google (GIS) in local/dev builds.
VITE_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=

# API base URL baked at build time (Vite inlines this).
# - Vite `npm run dev`: omit to use the `/api` proxy (vite.config.ts).
# - Docker Compose: defaults to `/api` (nginx proxies to the api service).
# - Staging/prod: bake `/api` behind a reverse proxy, OR an absolute
#   `https://api.example.com` URL. Rebuild the frontend image to change.
# Production builds fail if this is unset (no silent localhost fallback).
# VITE_API_BASE=/api

# Optional. Defaults to /downloads/LoomCapture-macos.zip (copied in by
# apps/desktop-agent/scripts/package-app.sh). Set this to a GitHub Release or
# object-storage URL if the zip is not baked into the frontend image.
# VITE_DESKTOP_AGENT_DOWNLOAD_URL=
